<title>USA: 1996 top 10 IPOs ranked by aftermarket performance.</title>
<headline>1996 top 10 IPOs ranked by aftermarket performance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following IPOs were 1996's top performing initial public offerings, ranked by the percentage change between their IPO price and their closing price on December 26, according to Securities Data Co:</p>
<p>COMPANY		     IPO   IPO    CLOSING     PCT   MANAGER</p>
<p>				DATE  PRICE  PRICE 12-26 CHANGE</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Cymer			9-18   9.50  41-5/8    +338.2%  MS</p>
<p>Outdoor Systems	  4-24  15     24-1/2    +264.8%  ALEXB</p>
<p>Paravant Computer	6-03   5	5-7/8    +252.5%  DUKE</p>
<p>Sipex			4-02   9.50  32-3/8    +240.8%  ALEXB</p>
<p>Sawtek		     5-01  13     42	  +223.1%  H&amp;Q</p>
<p>Ugly Duckling	    6-17   6.75  21	  +211.1%  CRUT</p>
<p>Sykes Enterprise	 4-29  18     37	  +208.3%  BAIRD</p>
<p>Trico Marine	     5-16  16     49	  +206.3% SCHR-W</p>
<p>Whittman-Hart	    5-03  16     24-1/8    +201.6%  DLJ</p>
<p>COHR Inc		   2-16   9     26-1/4    +191.7%  NEEDH</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are adjusted for stock splits.</p>
</text>
